D7 q19emit c40node D1N4148
C40 c40node 0 1u
R88 c40node c39node 33k
C39 c39node 0 0.47u

D6 q19emit c38node D1N4148
C38 c38node 0 1u
R87 c38node c37node 22k
C37 c37node 0 2.2u

R92 q20emit eg13node 33k
R89 eg13node 0 10k

* ==== Block 6: BP1 (U3-A), BP2 (U3-B) ====
* C10/C11 were deferred in block 3 (they hang on vsumnode but already
* lead into the BP1/BP2 input) -- connected here now.
C10 vsumnode a1 3.3n
R52 a1 s1 33k
C13 s1 m1 6.8n
C14 m1 bp1out 6.8n
R56 m1 0 560
R57 s1 bp1out 82k
