* ==== Block 7: VCA1 (Q18), VCA2 (Q17), VCA3 (Q16) ====
* VCA1: per netlist the Q18 collector is the same node as D12's
* cathode (block 4) -- d12k, no separate connection node.
R102 b1rail vca1bias 1e6
R103 vca1bias q18base 1e6
C46 bp1out q18base 22n
Q18 d12k q18base q18emit Q2SC945
R101 q18emit 0 100

* VCA2: Q17 collector = D11 cathode (d11k), R90/R91 load eg13node AND
* c39node (from block 5) onto the same node d11a.
