* VR7 100K(A): Taper A (audio/log), JIS.A '15A' reference curve (same class as CY VR6, VERIFIED there).
.param sd_VR7frac = {
+ (sd_vr7<=0.1) ? (0.0    + (sd_vr7-0.0)/0.1*(0.01-0.0))    :
+ (sd_vr7<=0.2) ? (0.01   + (sd_vr7-0.1)/0.1*(0.025-0.01))  :
