* circuit error): Q35's breakdown node no_n491 hangs on its bias via R128(1M)+C31(1u) --
* time constant ~1s (R128*C31), measured up to full settling ~2-5s. Without .ic (plain uic from 0V) the whole NOISE stage is far
* outside its operating point during this charging phase (U24A hangs
* on the +B4 rail, WN wrongly >13V instead of ~0V) -- exactly the same pattern as
* with CY's own slow nodes above, only not caught with .ic here before.
* Values taken from the isolated diagnostic run (
